#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Nhazi SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Ikike ngwaọrụ gị anaghị ekpuchi ngwaọrụ niile, ya mere ị gaghị enwe ike ibupụta ma ọ bụ ibubata nhazi SmokePing. Jụọ onye nchịkwa nwere ikike ịnweta ngwaọrụ niile."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Bupụta Nhazi SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Mbupụta ahụ nwere ntọala plugin, ebumnuche SmokePing ndị plugin gụrụ, na ngwaọrụ nke ọ bụla jikọrọ ya na ya, site na aha host na nkọwa ngwaọrụ ahụ. Ọ nweghị isi mmalite data, eserese, faịlụ RRD, ma ọ bụ nzere."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Budata"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Bubata Nhazi SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Ịhọrọ faịlụ na-enyocha ya naanị. Ihuenyo na-esote na-edepụta mgbanwe niile faịlụ ahụ ga-eme, a gaghịkwa ede ihe ọ bụla ruo mgbe ị kwadoro ndepụta ahụ. Mbubata na-agbakwunye ma na-emelite; ọ dịghị mgbe ọ na-ehichapụ ebumnuche ma ọ bụ ebufe njikọ, ọ dịghịkwa mgbe ọ na-eke faịlụ RRD ma ọ bụ emetụ ndekọ data SmokePing."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Nyochaa Faịlụ"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Nyocha Mbubata"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Edeghị ihe ọ bụla."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Azụ"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Enweghị ike ibubata faịlụ ahụ ruo mgbe e doziri mperi ndị a. Edeghị ihe ọ bụla."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Nwụnye ahụ dakọtara na faịlụ ahụ ugbua. Enweghị ihe a ga-ebubata."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Atụmatụ %s. Itinye ya na-eme kpọmkwem mgbanwe ndị a n'otu usoro ọrụ. Ọ bụrụ na faịlụ ahụ ma ọ bụ nwụnye ahụ gbanwere kemgbe nyocha a, a ga-ajụ mbubata ahụ ma ị ga-enyocha ọzọ."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Tinye Mbubata"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Kagbuo"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Tinye Ebumnuche SmokePing"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "enweghị ebumnuche SmokePing dabara"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Pịa Gaa n'ihu ka ị tinye ebumnuche SmokePing ndị host ha bụ aha host nke ngwaọrụ ọ bụla a họọrọ. Ebumnuche ọ bụla na-enweta eserese nchịkọta maka mkpu na, mgbe enwere ike ise data SmokePing, eserese smoke. A naghị eke ngwaọrụ ebe a."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "Ebumnuche %d dabara."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "E kere ma ọ bụ jikọọ ihe %d, a wụfuru %d."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Ngwaọrụ a nwere ebumnuche SmokePing, mana ngwa ọgụgụ na-ejupụta uru nchịkọta ha na-agba ọsọ na poller %d ma e chekwara ngwaọrụ ahụ na poller %d. Uru nchịkọta na mkpu na-akwụsị ruo mgbe e kenyere ngwaọrụ ahụ na poller %d ọzọ."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Ebumnuche SmokePing nke Ngwaọrụ a"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Eserese smoke %d ka na-ese agba ndị ọzọ; isi poller na-ebufe ruo 200 n'otu okirikiri."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Enweghị ike ibufe eserese smoke %d; gbaa upgrade-graphs ka ị nwaa ha ọzọ, ma lee ndekọ Cacti maka ihe kpatara ya."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Ntọala Loss Colors na-arịọ agba mfu SmokePing %s, mana ngwa ọgụgụ chọtara SmokePing %s. Tọọ ya ka ọ bụrụ Akpaka ma ọ bụrụ na eserese ekwesịghị ịdị iche na nke SmokePing."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Ntọala Loss Colors na-ahọrọ agba mfu SmokePing %s maka eserese smoke."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Ngwa ọgụgụ ahụghị ụdị SmokePing ọ bụla, ya mere ntọala Loss Colors na-ahọrọ agba mfu nke SmokePing 2.8 na nke na-abịa n'ihu. Ọ bụrụ na SmokePing bụ 2.7, tọọ Loss Colors ka ọ bụrụ SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Ngwa ọgụgụ chọtara SmokePing %s, ya mere ntọala Loss Colors na-ahọrọ agba mfu ya."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "Etinyebeghị Thold, ya mere ọ nweghị ebumnuche na-enye mkpu na ma SmokePing ma Thold."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Ọ nweghị ebumnuche nwere ma mkpu SmokePing ma oke Thold agbanyere."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Ebumnuche %d nwere ma mkpu SmokePing ma oke Thold agbanyere, ya mere otu nsogbu nwere ike izipu ọkwa ugboro abụọ. Tụnyere ọnọdụ mkpu ha tupu iwepụ nke ọ bụla: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Ndebiri SmokePing dara n'ibubata ma a naghị anwa ha ọzọ na akpaka: %s Jiri Nwaa Mbubata Ndebiri Ọzọ mgbe i dozisịrị ihe kpatara ya."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Ebubatabeghị ndebiri SmokePing. Jiri Nwaa Mbubata Ndebiri Ọzọ."

