#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "A na-agụ faịlụ SmokePing a haziri tinyere faịlụ ndị o tinyere, site na ndekọ nke ya. A na-agụ faịlụ e bulitere naanị ya: anaghị ekwe ka @include dị na ya."

