#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for an uploaded file: a SmokePing configuration of at most 4 MiB."
msgstr "Naanị maka faịlụ e bulitere: nhazi SmokePing nke kacha elu bụ 4 MiB."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Ngwaọrụ"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host groups targets that probe the same host. A device that already has the host name on the chosen poller is used instead of a new one."
msgstr "Otu ngwaọrụ maka otu host SmokePing na-achịkọta ebumnuche ndị na-enyocha otu host ahụ. A na-eji ngwaọrụ nwere aha host ahụ ugbua na poller a họọrọ kama nke ọhụrụ."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
