#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The poller of new devices. It must be the poller that runs the SmokePing reader, or their summary data sources get no data."
msgstr "Poller nke ngwaọrụ ọhụrụ. Ọ ga-abụrịrị poller na-agba ngwa ọgụgụ SmokePing, ma ọ bụghị ya, isi mmalite data nchịkọta ha agaghị enweta data."

