#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Osisi Eserese"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "Yie usoro SmokePing n'ime osisi eserese: ngalaba ọ bụla na-aghọ alaka, ngwaọrụ ọ bụla na-aghọ host n'okpuru alaka nke ebumnuche ya. A na-eji alaka na host ndị dị adị eme ihe ọzọ."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "A new tree, named below"
msgstr "Osisi ọhụrụ, a kpọrọ aha n'okpuru"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
