#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Naanị maka osisi ọhụrụ. A na-eji osisi nwere aha a ugbua eme ihe."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Preview reads the configuration and lists what the import would create. Nothing is written until you confirm that list on the next screen, and SmokePing's own files are never written."
msgstr "Nlele mbụ na-agụ nhazi ahụ ma depụta ihe mbubata ga-eke. A naghị ede ihe ọ bụla ruo mgbe ị kwadoro ndepụta ahụ na ihuenyo na-esote, ọ dịghịkwa mgbe a na-ede faịlụ SmokePing n'onwe ya."

