msgid "Seconds past one step for which a measurement still counts as current."
msgstr "Sekọnd gafere otu nzọụkwụ nke nha ka na-agụ dịka nke ugbu a."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Loss Colors"
msgstr "Agba Mfu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Which SmokePing loss colors the smoke graphs draw. SmokePing 2.7 draws other loss levels than 2.8 and later. Automatic follows the SmokePing version the reader finds next to SmokePing, shown on the health page, and uses 2.8 and later when it finds none."
msgstr "Agba mfu SmokePing nke ihe osise anwụrụ na-ese. SmokePing 2.7 na-ese ọkwa mfu dị iche na 2.8 na nke ndị na-esote. Nke Akpaaka na-eso ụdị SmokePing nke ihe ọgụgụ hụrụ n'akụkụ SmokePing, nke egosiri na ibe ahụike, ma na-eji 2.8 na nke ndị na-esote mgbe ọ hụghị nke ọ bụla."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Nke Akpaaka"

