msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its inventory, mapping, and health tables. SmokePing files are never removed either way."
msgstr "Mgbe akara dị na ya, iwepụ plọgin a na-edebe tebụl ndepụta nchịkọta, nkwekọ, na ahụike ya. A naghị ewepụ faịlụ SmokePing ma ọlị n'ụzọ ọ bụla."

