msgid "Where the uninstall writes its export of the plugin configuration. Leave blank to use the cache/smokeping directory of Cacti, which the plugin protects with a deny-all rule. A directory set here must already exist, be writable, and be outside the web root; when it is not writable no export is written."
msgstr "Ebe iwepụ plọgin na-ede mbupụ nke nhazi plọgin ahụ. Hapụ ya ka ọ tọgbọ chakoo iji jiri ndekọ cache/smokeping nke Cacti, nke plọgin ahụ na-echebe site na iwu deny-all. Ndekọ a họọrọ ebe a ga-adịrịrị adị, nwee ike ide ihe na ya, ma dịrị n'èzí mgbọrọgwụ webụ; mgbe a na-enweghị ike ide ihe na ya, a naghị ede mbupụ ọ bụla."

